1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,000
[The film is silent. These captions describe what is on screen.]

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:22,000
A camera fixed to the front of a cable car looks down Market Street, San Francisco.

3
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Horse-drawn wagons and open automobiles share the road ahead.

4
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Carriages cross in front of the car. People step between the tracks.

5
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:40,000
A streetcar runs alongside on the left.

6
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:10,000
The pavements are crowded on both sides.

7
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,000
A wagon with a pale load pulls away to the right.

8
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:10,000
An automobile passes close by on the left.

9
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:40,000
A streetcar crosses to the right. A man walks over the tracks.

10
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:10,000
A group stands talking at the kerb as the car goes by.

11
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:40,000
A man walks along the middle of the street ahead of the car.

12
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:10,000
Shopfronts and awnings on either side.

13
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:41,000
Further down the street, a clock tower comes into view.

14
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:10,000
A streetcar waits on the left. People cross in a loose crowd.

15
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:40,000
A horse pulls a cart across the road from left to right.

16
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:10,000
Carts and automobiles ahead. The tower is nearer now.

17
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:40,000
A man steps over the tracks in front of the car.

18
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:10,000
A streetcar and several automobiles pass.

19
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:40,000
A large automobile draws up close on the left.

20
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:10,000
The car follows an automobile down the last stretch.

21
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:40,000
An automobile cuts across directly in front.

22
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:10,000
A cable car stands at the right, the tower now close on the left.

23
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:41,000
The arched front of the Ferry Building fills the end of the street.

24
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:10,000
A delivery wagon passes close. Crowds move across the plaza.

25
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:45,000
The car turns and starts back up Market Street.
